{"id":"hora","lemma":"hora","pos":"noun","rank":183,"glosses":["hour (a time period of sixty minutes)","time (the moment, as indicated by a clock or similar device)","high time (usually with \"ya\")"],"ipa":"/ˈoɾa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"horas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/37/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-hora.wav","formAudio":{"horas":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/52/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Precision27-horas.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Ha llegado la hora.","en":"It's time.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/435829"},{"text":"Tomás trabajó horas extra.","en":"Tom worked overtime.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/455162"},{"text":"Ya casi es hora.","en":"It's about time.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/441861"},{"text":"Me pagan por horas.","en":"I'm paid by the hour.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/78929"},{"text":"Es hora del almuerzo.","en":"It's lunch time.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/441858"}]}